'''xenurine''' (zẹ̄-nū′rin), ''n.'' and ''a.'' [< ''Xenurus'' + ''-ine''<sup>1</sup>.] '''I.''' ''n.'' An armadillo of the genus ''Xenurus;'' a kabassou. {{smaller|In these forms of ''Dasypodidæ'' the buckler is more zoniferous than in the true dasypodines, and the tail is nearly naked; the feet are also somewhat peculiar in the proportions of the metacarpals and phalanges.}}

'''II.''' ''a.'' Of or pertaining to the genus ''Xenurus.''

